=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the supercharging air/air heat exchanger\nair duct back in its housing and secure it using the bolts.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3239044\">7210E10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238951\">7055A41</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238952\">7055A43</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238952\">7055A43</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238951\">7055A41</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3239044\">7210E10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238445\">5540B16</a>\n                                           (Left\nside</p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a), nut (1b) and remove the air duct for the\nsupercharging air/air heat exchanger (1c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069483.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\">